  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "双败淘汰制提案  (Bu Xiaogu Pitches Double Elimination)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When Kaiwen opens the presentation file, the conservative slides have vanished in favour of the full overhaul plan—and Chun Yuqiao calls on Bu Xiaogu to present her core design to the whole boardroom. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "新一季十二歌王将在一个月后进入筹备期。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "一如既往，我们会保留一些节目的精华。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "同时也会做一些调整，来适应新的市场需求。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "接下来介绍第三季十二歌王的全面改版计划。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "前几天我在医院，这个方案确实是我团队的人做的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但说实话，今天这个方案要上会的事，没人通知我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那就让策划人自己来介绍吧，这是你们仨谁做的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "布小谷做的全案，核心设计是布小谷。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那就挨个说，布小谷，站上面说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长好，各位领导好，我是总编室助理策划布小谷。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我要讲的是双败淘汰制。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "新一季十二歌王将在一个月后进入筹备期。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The new season of Twelve Singers enters pre-production in one month.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "一如既往，我们会保留一些节目的精华。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As always, we will preserve some of the finest elements of the show.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "同时也会做一些调整，来适应新的市场需求。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'At the same time we will make adjustments to meet new market demand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "接下来介绍第三季十二歌王的全面改版计划。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Next we present our comprehensive overhaul plan for Season Three of Twelve Singers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "前几天我在医院，这个方案确实是我团队的人做的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was in hospital these past few days; this proposal was indeed crafted by my team.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但说实话，今天这个方案要上会的事，没人通知我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet frankly, nobody notified me that this proposal was going before a meeting today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那就让策划人自己来介绍吧，这是你们仨谁做的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So let the planner introduce it in person—which of the three of you designed this?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "布小谷做的全案，核心设计是布小谷。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bu Xiaogu built the full proposal; the core format design is hers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那就挨个说，布小谷，站上面说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then speak in turn—Bu Xiaogu, step up to the front and present.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长好，各位领导好，我是总编室助理策划布小谷。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello Chairwoman and leaders; I am assistant planner Bu Xiaogu from the chief editor's office.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我要讲的是双败淘汰制。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What I am presenting today is the double-elimination format.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "新一季十二歌王将在一个月后进入筹备期。",
      "gap": 0.5
